# Microsoft Entra ID Administrative Role Assignments

## Cedar Valley Health Zero Trust Identity Lab

## Objective

Administrative roles were assigned based on job responsibilities while following the Principle of Least Privilege.

Users received only the permissions required to complete their assigned duties.

---

# Role Assignments

## Ethan Hughes — Global Administrator

Ethan Hughes was assigned the Global Administrator role due to his responsibility as Cloud Administrator.

This role provides extensive control over Microsoft Entra ID, including user management, security settings, and tenant configuration.

Because this is a highly privileged role, it requires strong security controls, monitoring, and limited assignment.

---

## Michael Rivera — User Administrator

Michael Rivera was assigned the User Administrator role as the IT Manager responsible for user account management.

This role allows user administration without granting unnecessary tenant-wide permissions.

---

## James Walker — Helpdesk Administrator

James Walker was assigned the Helpdesk Administrator role to support users with password resets and identity-related issues.

This provides required support access while limiting administrative privileges.

---

# Result

Administrative roles were successfully assigned using least privilege principles.
